flowchart TB
    subgraph Local[Local service]
        DB[(SQLite journal\nsignals / events / positions)]
        WS[Private WebSocket listener]
        HANDLERS[Event handlers]
        START[FastAPI startup recovery]
        TIMER[Periodic reconciler]
        WORKER[Post-submission retry worker]
        RECON[Reconciliation service]
    end

    subgraph Exchange[Exchange]
        STREAM[Private account streams]
        REST[REST API\nopen orders / order history / positions / TP-SL]
    end

    STREAM --> WS --> HANDLERS --> DB
    HANDLERS -->|position event triggers refresh| RECON
    START --> RECON
    TIMER --> RECON
    WORKER --> RECON
    RECON -->|read: orders / positions| REST
    RECON -->|conditional write: TP/SL| REST
    RECON <--> DB